                <pb facs="0565" n="453" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg453"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister
                    Sherrill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-17"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The minister at Lima telegraphs that the joint note was presented unsigned
                    because the minister of the Argentine Republic was not yet fully instructed. Has
                    he now full instructions?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
